    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Algebraic block.</li>
      <li>If input 1 is unconnected, the stored output is emitted; otherwise gain is resolved and multiplied by the input.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = gain\,u</latex>
